          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "കോണി (kōṇi) is of uncertain origin. DEDR lists a Malayalam kōṇi, but meaning \"gunny bag\" (DEDR appendix 33), a different word."
            }
          ]
        },
